# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and check out with LF on
# every platform. This matches rustfmt.toml (newline_style = "Unix"), keeps CI
# (Linux) and Windows checkouts identical, and eliminates the spurious
# "modified" flags caused by core.autocrlf=true on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixture files must never be normalized.
*.bin binary
